            <span style="Color: LightSteelBlue">“Anytime you need some release, come find us.”</span> <span style="color:DarkTurquoise">Richard</span> says, <span style="Color: LightSteelBlue">“You know, if you’re okay with this. No need to answer now; making decisions with post-nut brain is never good.”</span> He laughs, <span style="Color: LightSteelBlue">“But, if you ask for some ‘fun’ anytime in the future, we’ll take that as your answer.”</span> Both boys give you another smile before standing up, deciding to leave you to recover while <span style="color:DarkTurquoise">Arthur</span> heads to wash out his mouth. <br>
            <br>
            <span style="Color: LightSteelBlue">“As much as I love the taste, I’d hate for people to smell it on my breath.”</span> He jokes as they walk off. <span style="Color: LightGreen">This leaves you alone in the clearing, spent and still processing what just happened.</span> <br>
