        You shake your head, telling them you’re not really comfortable with this. <span style="color:DarkTurquoise">Arthur</span> frowns, but only briefly before standing up. <span style="Color: LightSteelBlue">“No worries. We wanted to offer, but we’d never want to make you uncomfortable.”</span> He says as he fixes your clothes and <span style="color:DarkTurquoise">Richard</span> releases you. <span style="Color: LightSteelBlue">“Sorry if we scared you, it was my idea. Thought it would be fun, if you were into it. But like I said, no worries.”</span> <br>
        <br>
        <span style="Color: LightSteelBlue">“We have a bit of a pair of lewd minds.”</span> <span style="color:DarkTurquoise">Richard</span> laughs nervously, <span style="Color: LightSteelBlue">“We forget sometimes not everyone is into that stuff like we are. Hope this doesn’t make things awkward.”</span> Both boys laugh nervously, clearly worried they took their thanks a little far and hoping it doesn’t ruin your friendship. Though you were caught off guard, you tell them not to worry. <span style="Color: LightGreen">You appreciate the offer but want to just be friends.</span> <br>
